 1965779, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/30e488e3/uploads/origins/16d76ea3-fea6-48b4-8741-5d33e193e37c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1b8c1aba7c37fb04eb0fd12db29acc39", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/30e488e3/uploads/origins/16d76ea3-fea6-48b4-8741-5d33e193e37c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4d38e2fa0ff365297855e40c0844ee7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Nice to meet you Takasukei-san!\n\nI just look through some of your other Pixel art works on Skeb and really really love it!\n\nI would like to request an animation of my Vtuber character Hiroshi\nHe is an A.I come from the virtual gaming world and loves playing FPS game(Apex,CSGO)\n\nSo, may I request an animation that my charater holding a gun running  with my little friend (floating around Hiroshi)\n\nHere's the refferences for my request:\n\nHiroshi's refferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/2/folders/1-3FOq7X-I7tFRU9AzCisIjzIGKq0S2py\n\nLittle firends refferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1wqGJq3XOz1-A11dNnHssBlBjkwg2CVKa/view?usp=drive_link\n\nI would like to use the request for my treaming(youtube) and on my X(twitter)\n\nThx for you time!\n\nThankyou!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4cc8169a/uploads/origins/66146509-6138-4e60-a4f3-9df44ca95bc9?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=4b9b895cb4057971513e944e7e3caeb9", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 177, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 3033681, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/682a9cbb/uploads/origins/f1f0e7da-1768-4f8f-bfc7-c36cd8e133e4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6af74b84ff49b99a8195eb63211e6d41", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/682a9cbb/uploads/origins/f1f0e7da-1768-4f8f-bfc7-c36cd8e133e4?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=22edeb1a5aa31636ac731e84bb3fe7e7", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! Thank you for accepting my previous commission! I like this pose you did... https://skeb.jp/@takasukei/works/10\n\nNice to meet you, I'm looking at your wonderful work. I would like to ask my teacher to draw an illustration of my original character, so if possible, I would appreciate it. I'll leave the poses, so I hope you have fun drawing! It would also be helpful if the address and signature could be turned on/off in the PSD layer. I would appreciate your consideration. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSource: https://drive.google.com/file/d/17FXTck70UeXvyVkP-QgProDXabLewa6a/view?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/17FXTck70UeXvyVkP-QgProDXabLewa6a/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 3033681, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37767428/uploads/origins/6ba3e968-0c05-454b-82fb-3bb7bbe196c0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=562f3e10cec9ed15bca6e4b168fa2353", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/37767428/uploads/origins/6ba3e968-0c05-454b-82fb-3bb7bbe196c0?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8d74ce3b44f0b9b44b82d1fbc27ac8a9", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! I like this pose you did... https://skeb.jp/@takasukei/works/7\n\nNice to meet you, I'm looking at your wonderful work. I would like to ask my teacher to draw an illustration of my original character, so if possible, I would appreciate it. I'll leave the poses, so I hope you have fun drawing! It would also be helpful if the address and signature could be turned on/off in the PSD layer. I would appreciate your consideration. Thank you for your understanding.\n\nSource: https://drive.google.com/file/d/17FXTck70UeXvyVkP-QgProDXabLewa6a/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 1404429, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3dce834b/uploads/origins/bdcba30f-91a9-4d24-bf9d-389f2fd28c62?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=424413abae366015bbf0a817152ae20f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3dce834b/uploads/origins/bdcba30f-91a9-4d24-bf9d-389f2fd28c62?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1b6c105b6d2080ec0124b3381dbbbd9e", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、先生。\n私はあなたのピクセルワークが好きで、できればループ可能なgif/videoのリクエストを送りたかったのです。\n\n以下の動画から、この歩行サイクルのような3人のキャラクターが歩く（ループする）ものをお願いしたいです。\n(https://imgur.com/a/YtsEiNI)\n私のVtuberが真ん中で、手前が猫の女の子、奥が緑色の髪の女の子になります。また、私のVtuberは他の女の子よりも背が高いです。\n\n普段のスタイルでも、ちびっこスタイルでも、自由に使ってください。背景は透明でも真っ白でもどちらでも大丈夫です。\nもし、JPYが足りないようなら、アピールしてください（笑）！\nありがとうございます。\n\n以下、キャラクターの参考資料です。\nVtuberのアバター: https://imgur.com/a/KMYVCr7\n猫娘(前)： https://imgur.com/a/VJGISHl\n緑髪の女の子: https://imgur.com/a/tCXBNkL", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 1447841, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee0d3f0a/uploads/origins/647ea7da-71a9-40be-afb7-2bed3db51e70?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aac364a36c72a46d8e1885f983b59b29", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee0d3f0a/uploads/origins/647ea7da-71a9-40be-afb7-2bed3db51e70?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=512f79de14a971db327da38d7864a47f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "美しい絵ですね！https://skeb.jp/@takasukei/works/13 に掲載されているこの作品と同じようなブロー・キス・アニメーションの作品をぜひお願いします。\n\nShanbaeはゲームが大好きなストリーマーで、楽しいことをするのが好き。\n\n背景は透明にしてください。Twitchライブストリームで私のストリームの背景とサムネイルとして使用されます。\n\n目の下にアイマークを入れていただけるとありがたいですが、必須ではありません。\n\n参考：https://imgur.com/a/aKD1GPr", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@takasukei/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1214268, "client_id": 1975994, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea4aebde/uploads/origins/70ef2300-b4bb-4160-9eef-4d0974a59e2e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4cc8f35519e5dfabe897f6117c074f30", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea4aebde/uploads/origins/70ef2300-b4bb-4160-9eef-4d0974a59e2e?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&